.env
.archon-horizon/vcs/
.archon-horizon/locks/
.claude/agents/
.codex/agents/
# Lean build artifacts — large; never commit (shared packagesDir + per-project builds)
.lake/
.lake-packages/
.shared-packages/
*.olean
*.ilean

# Ignore local git-dir databases (large pack files)
**/git-dir/

# Local pre-refactor backup copy of the main project (genus-0 snapshot) — local only
/MainProjects/Algebraic-Jacobian-Challenge-*/
# ...but the Rebuild is a first-class registered project (config.yaml), not a backup:
!/MainProjects/Algebraic-Jacobian-Challenge-Rebuild/
.archon-horizon/cache/

# Scratch Lean probes dropped by a session. The rule was ROOT-ANCHORED and matched
# only the substring "probe", so it covered nothing inside a member project and nothing
# named otherwise: pic-e's zz_pice_axioms*.lean reached HEAD via another lane's
# integrate sweep in run 0095. Both gaps widened. Keep probes worth retaining under the
# session's own probes/ directory instead.
/*probe*.lean
*probe*.lean
zz_*.lean
scratch_*.lean
.palimpsest/
